# Play → test → fix

When the user asks to keep playing, testing, and fixing live (or invokes
`/play-test-fix` / a durable play goal), follow
`.cursor/skills/play-test-fix/SKILL.md`.

Ship every product fix via `.cursor/skills/ship-change/SKILL.md`. Stay synced
with `origin/main`. Drive only the agent iPhone 17 Pro UDID; leave the user’s
iPhone 17 instance alone (notify them if you relaunch it).

For launching the app / Device Hub (Xcode 27+), see
`docs/agent-ios-simulator.md`.
